By Cauchy-Schwarz,
\[(a^2 + b^2)(1 + 1) \ge (a + b)^2 = t^2,\]so $a^2 + b^2 \ge \frac{t^2}{2}.$

Equality occurs when $a = b = \frac{t}{2},$ so the minimum value is $\boxed{\frac{t^2}{2}}.$The answer is \frac{t^2}{2}

