solution:
rname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v}.$  Then
\[\mathbf{v} - \mathbf{p} = \mathbf{v} - \operatorname{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v}\]is orthogonal to $\mathbf{w}.$

